\chapter{System Architecture and Agent Roles}
\section{Hybrid Architecture}
The system combines cloud intelligence (Groq, Gemini) with local intelligence (Ollama, Whisper, FAISS). FastAPI acts as the backend orchestration layer. React serves the user-facing channels (Store, My Orders, Chat, Voice Mode, Admin).

