\chapter{Limitations}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*]
    \item Limited automated test coverage for full production confidence.
    \item Real OMS/CRM integrations are still mocked or internalized.
    \item Local model latency and cold starts can affect first-turn responsiveness.
    \item Admin/security controls require stronger auth and role hardening.
\end{itemize}

