\textbf{Phase} & \textbf{Duration} & \textbf{Deliverables} \\
\hline
Requirement analysis & Week 1--2 & PRD, architecture draft, domain scenarios \\
\hline
Core backend build & Week 3--5 & FastAPI routes, graph integration, data layer \\
\hline
Frontend and UX & Week 6--8 & Store/chat/voice/admin interfaces \\
\hline
RAG and voice integration & Week 9--10 & FAISS retrieval, streaming voice pipeline \\
\hline
Testing and hardening & Week 11--12 & bug fixes, output normalization, order context logic \\
\hline
Report and demo prep & Week 13--14 & final report, screenshots, demo scripts \\
\hline
\end{tabularx}
\end{table}

